    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Distinguish between 73rd Amendment (Schedule 11, 29 subjects) and 74th Amendment (Schedule 12, 18 subjects).",
        "Note that the minimum age for contesting local body elections is 21 years (under Articles 243F and 243V).",
        "State Election Commission (Article 243K) conducts local elections, while State Finance Commission (Article 243I) reviews financial position every 5 years."
      ],
